{"s":62,"v":[{"t":"Whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth is exalting Allāh, the Sovereign, the Pure, the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","w":[["يُسَبِّحُ","Glorifies","yusabbiḥu",""],["لِلَّهِ","Allah","lillahi","",[["لِ",8],["لَّهِ",9]]],["مَا","whatever","mā",""],["فِى","(is) in","fī",""],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","the heavens","l-samāwāti","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",49]]],["وَمَا","and whatever","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["فِى","(is) in","fī",""],["ٱلْأَرْضِ","the earth","l-arḍi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["ٱلْمَلِكِ","the Sovereign","l-maliki","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مَلِكِ",631]]],["ٱلْقُدُّوسِ","the Holy","l-qudūsi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قُدُّوسِ",2567]]],["ٱلْعَزِيزِ","the All-Mighty","l-ʿazīzi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَزِيزِ",130]]],["ٱلْحَكِيمِ","the All-Wise","l-ḥakīmi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَكِيمِ",133]]]]},{"t":"It is He who has sent among the unlettered [Arabs] a Messenger from themselves reciting to them His verses and purifying them and teaching them the Book [i.e., the Qur’ān] and wisdom [i.e., the sunnah] - although they were before in clear error -","w":[["هُوَ","He","huwa",""],["ٱلَّذِى","(is) the One Who","alladhī",""],["بَعَثَ","sent","baʿatha",""],["فِى","among","fī",""],["ٱلْأُمِّيِّـۧنَ","the unlettered","l-umiyīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أُمِّيِّـۧنَ",1133]]],["رَسُولًۭا","a Messenger","rasūlan",""],["مِّنْهُمْ","from themselves","min'hum","",[["مِّنْ",6],["هُمْ",3]]],["يَتْلُوا۟","reciting","yatlū",""],["عَلَيْهِمْ","to them","ʿalayhim","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِمْ",3]]],["ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ","His Verses","āyātihi","",[["ءَايَـٰتِ",39],["هِۦ",5]]],["وَيُزَكِّيهِمْ","and purifying them","wayuzakkīhim","",[["وَ",1],["يُزَكِّي",725],["هِمْ",3]]],["وَيُعَلِّمُهُمُ","and teaching them","wayuʿallimuhumu","",[["وَ",1],["يُعَلِّمُ",296],["هُمُ",3]]],["ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","the Book","l-kitāba","",[["ٱلْ",2],["كِتَـٰبَ",63]]],["وَٱلْحِكْمَةَ","and the wisdom","wal-ḥik'mata","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["حِكْمَةَ",508]]],["وَإِن","although","wa-in","",[["وَ",1],["إِن",27]]],["كَانُوا۟"